&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for managing customer relationships and digital marketing strategy for key clients in the luxury retail and beauty segment. &amp;nbsp;Ideal candidates will have 3 - 5 years experience in paid media, and experience managing a team of coordinators to support campaign execution. &amp;nbsp; The candidate should be extremely skilled in analyzing the effectiveness of each campaign, and be able to present actionable analysis to their clients and other internal teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for professionals looking to expand their experience across both paid digital and top of funnel brand strategy. &amp;nbsp;With that, career progression could then lead into our in-house digital consulting business. &amp;nbsp;January Digital offers competitive salaries, unlimited vacation, covers our employees’ healthcare, 401k and profit sharing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Duties/Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building trust and credibility at all levels of client organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish, plan, and deliver your client’s digital marketing and brand strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicating campaign metrics and making recommendations to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceeding client expectations for agency levels of service, frequently working within client offices with C-level executives.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading team of coordinators, including on-going training and support to new hires as you grow &amp;nbsp;your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an active member in the January Digital community and culture&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Knowledge and Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of digital marketing experience,&amp;nbsp; directly executing and managing large, intricate paid search campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced expertise in forecasting budgets and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced expertise in Google AdWords, Google Analytics andand Paid Social&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and an understanding of advanced methodologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and experience leading teams are a must&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and operate outside your comfort zone is critical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using DS, Kenshoo or Marin a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Luxury experience is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
